  Actually let me trace it exactly:
  stbds_load_32_or_64(a, temp, 2147001325, 0x27bb2ee6, 0x87b0b0fd):
    temp = 0x87b0b0fd ^ 2147001325 = 0x87b0b0fd ^ 0x7fff7b6d
    temp <<= 16; temp <<= 16; temp >>= 16; temp >>= 16  (this zeros out the upper 32 bits on 64-bit, keeping lower 32)
